1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,762
How to Handle Criticism Well.

2
00:00:02,712 --> 00:00:06,187
Receiving criticism triggers a threat response.

3
00:00:06,187 --> 00:00:09,562
The first instinct may be to defend oneself.

4
00:00:09,562 --> 00:00:13,800
Pausing and breathing before responding creates space to process.

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:17,300
Separating the message from its delivery is crucial.

6
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:21,700
Even poorly expressed criticism may contain useful information.

7
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:25,525
Asking clarifying questions before responding helps.

8
00:00:25,525 --> 00:00:33,537
Distinguishing between constructive feedback, meant to help improvement, and destructive criticism, meant to wound, is important.

9
00:00:33,537 --> 00:00:37,500
The source matters; not all opinions carry equal weight.

10
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:42,800
The ability to hear hard truths without crumbling accelerates growth in every domain.

